OL,3,AUS televangelist Jim Bakker, disgraced
OL,4,Afrom sex scandal and fraud, dies at 86
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS televangelist Jim Bakker, who built
OL,7,Fa multimillion-dollar media empire
OL,8,Fbefore being jailed for fraud and
OL,9,Fconspiracy, has died aged 86.
OL,11,FBakker and his then-wife Tammy Faye
OL,12,Ffounded a Christian television
OL,13,Fprogramme called The PTL Club in 1974,
OL,14,Fwhich at its peak attracted 13 million
OL,15,Fviewers per day.
OL,17,FThe 86-year-old's death was announced
OL,18,Fon Monday by his second wife Lori
OL,19,FBakker, who described him as "a pioneer
OL,20,Fof Christian television".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
