OL,3,AUS televangelist Jim Bakker, disgraced
OL,4,Afrom sex scandal and fraud, dies at 86
OL,5,
OL,6,FBy the late '80s, Bakker and Tammy
OL,7,FFaye's empire began to fall apart after
OL,8,Fhe became embroiled in a sex scandal
OL,9,Fand later convicted of mail and wire
OL,10,Ffraud. Tammy Faye, who divorced him in
OL,11,F1992, was never charged.
